@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk/vendor/audio-capture/*-darwin/**
@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk/vendor/audio-capture/*-linux/**

# onnxruntime-node ships native binaries for every platform. Only the win32
# binding is needed on Windows; the darwin/linux ELF and dylib .node files
# break cross-platform bundling (rcedit fails on non-PE .node files) and would
# otherwise be shipped wastefully in the app.
onnxruntime-node/bin/napi-v6/darwin/**
onnxruntime-node/bin/napi-v6/linux/**
